// Data-driven robe (garment) appearance table.
//
// Generated from the CondaRO client lua data (`data\luafiles514\lua files\datainfo\
// spriterobeid.lub`, `spriterobename.lub`, `spriterobename_f.lub` and
// `transparentitem/transparentitem.lub`). Every entry is one robe view id:
//
// * `names` - sprite folder names of the robe, most preferred first. The
//   archive layout is `data\sprite\로브\<name>\...`; older robes use the
//   Korean name, newer cash robes use the English `_f` name, so both are
//   tried and missing candidates are skipped cleanly.
// * `alpha` - animated opacity window from `querytransparentiteminfo`
//   (`from`, `to`, `period` in milliseconds). Robes without an entry are
//   fully opaque.
//
// The table is embedded as the compiled fallback and can be overridden in the
// client archive (`data\client\robes.ron`).
